### Hi, I'm Kody 👋

I build desktop apps, web services, developer tools, and business software with C#/.NET, Avalonia, Rust, Angular, Vue, and Bash/PowerShell. I like keyboard shortcuts, fast feedback, and tools that respect your time and your data. I use Windows 10 and Void Linux.

Most of my projects start with "this should be easier" and grow from there.
